<title>JAPAN: DDI Corp shares fall on loss forecast. [CORRECTED 04:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>DDI Corp shares fall on loss forecast. [CORRECTED 04:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to show company announced a forecast for its earnings and not actual results.)</p>
<p>Shares in DDI Corp were down in Tuesday morning trade, depressed by the company's forecast of a hefty loss in its group earnings for the six months to September 30, 1996, announced late last week, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0126 GMT, the shares were down 43,000 yen at 805,000 yen.</p>
